OL,3,GNEWSANew measures could help meet
OL,4,Aelectricity demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA combination of electricity imports,
OL,7,Fsolar and wind power could meet nearly
OL,8,Fall of Guernsey's future electricity
OL,9,Frequirements, the States of Guernsey
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FMore than 90% of power consumed in
OL,13,FGuernsey each year comes through an
OL,14,Funder-sea electricity cable from
OL,15,FFrance, via Jersey.
OL,17,FA second cable, however, could now be
OL,18,Fup and running on the island by 2030,
OL,19,Fproviding a new link for importing
OL,20,Felectricity. It would be financed
OL,21,Fthrough loans to Guernsey Electricity,
OL,22,Ffrom or guaranteed by the States.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
