OL,3,GNEWSANew measures could help meet
OL,4,Aelectricity demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis, combined with the development of
OL,7,Flocal renewable energy to lower carbon
OL,8,Femissions, is expected to help the
OL,9,Fisland cope with an expected 30%
OL,10,Fincrease in peak demand by 2050, the
OL,11,FStates said.
